        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela oyo Johane kasamide masani aaboya bwankamele, alutambo lwacikanda mucibuno cakwe, alimwi zilyo zyakwe kazili cisozi abuci bwamusokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
