        {
          "text": "nkabela mutayeeyi kwaamba mumyoyo yanu kuti, Tulijisi Abrahamu mbuli taateesu, pe, nkaambo ndamwaambila kuti Leza ulakonzya kusandula mabwe aya, abe bana bakwe Abrahamu, ",
